Package: maludb-api
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-psycopg,
 python3-python-multipart, python3-httpx, python3-cryptography, curl
Recommends: postgresql-18-maludb-core, maluos-firstboot, python3-cryptography
Description: MaluDB API server (FastAPI) as a system service
 The MaluDB Python API server: a REST/JSON gateway over a MaluDB memory
 database (subjects, memories, documents, episodes, skills, principals,
 MCP, model prompts). Tokens are minted against PostgreSQL logins and
 kept in a local auth store. Runs as the maludb-api system user on
 127.0.0.1:8000 by default; configuration in /etc/maludb/maludb-api.env.
 .
 Ships the periodic embedding and reindex sweeps as timers, and a MaluOS
 first-boot component that gives the tenant a database password, seals
 the auth store, mints the tenant's API token and enables the sweeps.
